WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:06,800
Do you think we are the only ones keeping an eye on this place?

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:13,660
The underground official affairs of the Japanese army in Dongxia Tomb were only peripheral.

3
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:17,260
What the boss really wants is the main entrance

4
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:23,710
And that pregnant woman of yours

5
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:28,510
Someone should be looking for her by now

6
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:33,220
You should never understand her
